  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 508.05 Application Approval",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 508.05 Application Approval.\n\n(a) An application for an initial or vanity registration plate shall be approved if the requested combination of characters conforms with the requirements of Saf-C 513.62(c) and it is not currently in use.\n\n(b) Upon approval, the department shall have permanent initial or vanity registration plates manufactured and forward them to the registrant.\n\nSource. #12581, eff 7-20-18 (formerly Saf-C 509.04); ss by #12914, eff 11-6-19; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 509.05)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
